d my interest. It would be great if someone could upload another copy without any missing pages. I am not sure if there would be any more missing pages ahead. No offense please. Just mentioned because its hard to miss on such great info and move ahead. \nThanks!","reviewtitle":"Missing pages","reviewer":"Cherry25","reviewdate":"2015-08-24 02:59:28","createdate":"2015-08-24 02:59:28","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"Page 15 is the end of index page which finishes in the middle of the said page & page 16 is left blank intentionally, As you will find it in many books. And the first \" addhyay\" that is chapter 1 starts right after intentionally left blank page which is in fact page one and so on.\n\nSo we aren't missing on \" Bhagvadgeeta\".\n\nHopefully this helps!","reviewtitle":"No missing pages ","reviewer":"Veronica.86","reviewdate":"2015-09-30 16:26:36","createdate":"2015-09-30 16:26:36","stars":"5"}],"server":"ia902906.us.archive.org","uniq":216200410,"workable_servers":["ia902906.us.archive.org","ia802906.us.archive.org"]}